    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d9e1dcfc6bc0aa547c07a72b",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "这样堂堂正正地发起挑战的话，\r\n我不就只能堂堂正正地接受了吗。\r\n哼哼……小特真是的♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "996c3607ad939d829dce39c68b8ff4f00f9d9e000bce52d14354fc261d9886cf",
