    {
      "uid": "zhcn:143e0b865189fba9b65289e8",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论是谁都能够照料得到……\r\n丸善小姐真是令人钦佩。\r\n可得报答这份恩情呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f09ef0c40f22d8629ef29add7173ac7765d67c1f7dcbb5bafb57af823d2591c",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
