    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5cb0ac0d75139ca9a0818d43",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不要急躁，悠～闲地冷静下来吧。\r\n越是忙的时候就越要放～松。\r\n做事最重要的就是平常心哦。",
      "source_fingerprint": "f6ab79d7b612e2f1dcea05f96eb847f385be9b658b91a7b99dbb5dbb50e557d7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
