    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9831e1373cdb826fa7a3c2dd",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "无论是哪种舞步都放马过来哟～。\r\n这副日日精进舞蹈所锻炼出来的身体，\r\n敬请见证。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0cfdffe71014b0d000947ebd383c388018b2760a1473d9ba2043be43cf528faa",
