    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:18742c9f380707620d084631",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "“自己笠上雪，虽厚不觉重”。\r\n无论是多么艰苦的训练也全是为了自己。",
      "source_fingerprint": "52ee1f5dd3b5b6dd2697ae6df3b0b3281ed6c868090ff4feaa58890cb3746643",
