    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bed176a875e3b7c18891ce4f",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "海马是红色的，A-I-U-E-O。\r\n嗯，看来今天也能好好地咏唱出魔法了呢。",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a396aa1ff812ed27c0670f0f3319e1e1e51a3cdcf159a3287b4ce69b5e73a70",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
