    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e3546291bb126adcb9f96565",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "虽然俗话说“有福不用忙”……\r\n但睡前的努力才是结果的源泉。\r\n那么，一起来为了明天的冒险而做足准备吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "081d77cbc15a542219abe3e622e71cf58ed2f54de25876e2d838b485dc485537",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
