    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b8c603f4ecd35c3b61c5c471",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在这炎热的夏天里，\r\n就让我们一起享受日本自古以来的魔道具……\r\n风铃【Cool Charm】的恩惠吧。",
      "source_fingerprint": "cad682c9d14b59f8d5920190c7643cf25a1ea53bd25cc8b66a5cf2c74a6328da",
