    {
      "uid": "zhcn:58588a131baf5a89398d01b5",
      "kind": "character_system",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "呼……天气这么冷的话，\r\n就会让人想去温泉旅馆里回复一下了呢。\r\n顺带再喝上一瓶咖啡牛奶【药水】♪",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf63667863dd577fdb1987ec5a08ac07e511a70ec5224604a12ec348d6a19e29",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
